  "description": "Dynamic RBAC and JWT authentication for ASP.NET Core, with permissions auto-discovered from your real endpoints via EndpointDataSource: no manual permission maps to keep in sync. Includes refresh token rotation with reuse detection, 2FA (TOTP/email), Google social login, full account lifecycle (registration, activation, password reset, lockout), rate limiting, and native OpenAPI docs. Built with Vertical Slice Architecture on minimal APIs, no MVC, no MediatR.",
